        "hotel": {
            "name": "Avlida Hotel",
            "strapline": "Popular hotel in a great location",
            "description": "<p>The Avlida Hotel is perfectly positioned to enjoy everything that makes Paphos one of Cyprus&rsquo;s most popular destinations.</p>\n<p>With great beaches, ancient sites and loads of kid-friendly attractions and activities, there&rsquo;s a lot to love, and it&rsquo;s all within easy reach of the hotel &ndash; in fact, the Tomb of the Kings is just across the road. You can walk to the beach in 10 minutes, too.</p>\n<p>But if you&rsquo;d rather stay put, there&rsquo;s plenty to enjoy at the hotel itself. With two outdoor pools and a spacious sun terrace, you're well set for swimming and sunbathing sessions. For the winter period, there's a steam room, along with a sauna, a Jacuzzi, and massage treatments to really help you unwind.</p>\n<p>Kids will appreciate the playground, children&rsquo;s pools and games room, and everyone will enjoy the entertainment programme that includes live music, quizzes, karaoke and games for the young and the young at heart.</p>\n<p>If you&rsquo;re dining at the hotel you&rsquo;ll find a wide choice at the buffet restaurant, including a dedicated section just for children. There&rsquo;s a great variety of eateries in the neighbourhood too, and dozens more at Paphos&rsquo; buzzing harbour, a 10-minute drive away.</p>\n<p>As for the rooms, they&rsquo;re bright and spacious and each one has a private balcony &ndash; some with sea views &ndash; where you can enjoy your morning coffee.</p>",
            "starRating": "4",
            "rating": 4.5,
